{"sha": "cbd2a5b398a211afa4fa8a3fb40a248cdb40168be029c98a6f124bbe5e3df663", "body": ["\\emph{平方差：}", "$x^2 - 81 = (x+9)(x-9)$，且", "\\[", "(2x+1)^2 - 9 = (2x+1)^2 - 3^2 = (2x+1+3)(2x+1-3) = (2x+4)(2x-2).", "\\]", "各因式中仍有公因式：$(2x+4)(2x-2) = 2(x+2) \\times", "2(x-1) = 4(x+2)(x-1)$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{方程}", "", "\\begin{method}[一元一次方程]\\label{met:g9:algebra:firstdegree}", "求解形如 $5x - 3 = 2x + 9$ 的方程：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将含 $x$ 的项移到方程一边，常数项移到另一边，", "        方法是对两边加上同一个量；", "  \\item 化简方程两边；", "  \\item 方程两边同除以 $x$ 的系数；", "  \\item 将所得解代入原方程进行检验。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:algebra:firstdegree}", "\\begin{align*}", "5x - 3 &= 2x + 9 \\\\", "5x - 2x &= 9 + 3 && \\text{(两边同时加上 $3 - 2x$)}\\\\", "3x &= 12 \\\\", "x &= 4 && \\text{（两边同除以 3）。}", "\\end{align*}", "检验：$5 \\times 4 - 3 = 17$，$2 \\times 4 + 9 = 17$。方程的解为", "$4$。", "", "含括号时，先展开：$3(x - 2) = x + 8$ 化为 $3x - 6 = x + 8$，", "于是 $2x = 14$，$x = 7$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[零因子法则]\\label{thm:g9:algebra:zeroproduct}", "两个数的积为零，当且仅当至少有一个因式为零：", "\\[", "A \\times B = 0", "\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad", "A = 0 \\ \\text{ 或 } \\ B = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "若某一因式为零，则积显然为零。反之，若 $A B = 0$ 且", "$A \\neq 0$，两边同除以 $A$ 得 $B = 0$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:algebra:zeroproduct}", "解方程 $(x - 3)(2x + 10) = 0$：或 $x - 3 = 0$，或 $2x + 10 = 0$，故", "解为 $3$ 与 $-5$。", "", "解方程 $x^2 - 49 = 0$：先因式分解，$(x-7)(x+7) = 0$，解为 $7$ 与", "$-7$。", "", "解方程 $x^2 = 3x$：切勿两边同除以 $x$！移项并分解：", "$x^2 - 3x = x(x - 3) = 0$，解为 $0$ 与 $3$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{不等式}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[不等式的性质]\\label{prop:g9:algebra:ineq}", "不等式两边同时加上同一个数时，不等号方向不变，", "两边同乘同一个\\emph{正数}时，同样成立。", "两边同乘一个\\emph{负数}时，", "不等号方向改变。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "若 $a \\leq b$，则 $b - a \\geq 0$。加上 $c$：$(b+c) - (a+c) = b - a", "\\geq 0$，故 $a + c \\leq b + c$。乘以 $c > 0$：", "$bc - ac = (b-a)c \\geq 0$，故 $ac \\leq bc$。乘以 $c < 0$：", "$(b-a)c \\leq 0$，故 $ac \\geq bc$，不等号方向改变。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:algebra:ineq}", "解不等式 $7 - 2x < 15$：", "\\begin{align*}", "7 - 2x &< 15 \\\\", "-2x &< 8 && \\text{(两边同减 7)} \\\\", "x &> -4 && \\text{（两边同除以 $-2$，不等号方向改变）。}", "\\end{align*}", "解集为所有大于 $-4$ 的数：在数轴上，", "以空心点表示 $-4$，并向右涂色。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-6.4,0) -- (2.6,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\foreach \\x in {-6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2}", "    \\draw (\\x,-0.07) -- (\\x,0.07);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (-4,-0.12) {$-4$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.12) {$0$};", "  \\draw[omDef, very thick] (-4,0.02) -- (2.5,0.02);", "  \\draw[omDef, fill=white, thick] (-4,0.02) circle (2.4pt);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 不等式 $7 - 2x < 15$ 的解：所有满足 $x > -4$ 的数（空心点：$-4$", "本身不是解）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g9:algebra:1}", "展开并化简：", "\\[", "4(3x - 2), \\qquad", "(x + 6)(x + 2), \\qquad", "(2x - 3)(x + 5), \\qquad", "(x - 1)(x - 9).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}